    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cards are soldiers. Your deck is your army. Your fortress is the last thing standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo Bastion fuses tactical turn-based combat, tower defense pressure, and brutal deckbuilding into one grim siege.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy. Command. Survive. Or fall \u2014 and lose everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0\ud83c\udff0 DEFEND THE LAST FORTRESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is lost. Only <strong>Arx Ultima</strong> stands. In <i>Echo Bastion</i>, you command the last line of defense in a fusion of <strong>turn-based tactics</strong>, <strong>deckbuilding</strong>, and <strong>tower defense</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682750/extras/bec0650653f79bc593f978e8495b05c3.poster.avif?t=1746731083\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682750/extras/bec0650653f79bc593f978e8495b05c3.webm?t=1746731083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682750/extras/bec0650653f79bc593f978e8495b05c3.mp4?t=1746731083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83c\udfb4 BUILD YOUR DECK \u2014 AND THEN SURVIVE WITH IT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card in your deck is a <strong>living unit</strong> \u2014 soldiers, machines, or tactical support.<br> Deploy them to the battlefield and take direct control.<br> But beware: deployed cards are <strong>exhausted</strong> until they survive the mission.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unit cards can be used only once per skirmish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u2694\ufe0f GAMEPLAY LOOP</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan</strong> your deck before each mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deploy</strong> units using limited action points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control</strong> them on a grid-based battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend</strong> your bastion through tactical positioning, synergy, and sacrifice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt</strong> after every mission with new cards, upgrades, and hard choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 FEATURES</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based tactical combat</strong> with unit positioning, movement, and range</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deckbuilding with roguelite progression</strong> \u2013 every mission matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower defense </strong>\u2013 defend against escalating demonic waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, intense missions</strong> \u2013 5\u201310 minutes per battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted pixel art</strong> in a grimdark war-torn world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No RNG</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682750/extras/3e7aaccb3565f4c2a290b2bfeef89f5c.poster.avif?t=1746731083\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682750/extras/3e7aaccb3565f4c2a290b2bfeef89f5c.webm?t=1746731083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682750/extras/3e7aaccb3565f4c2a290b2bfeef89f5c.mp4?t=1746731083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the Great War shattered the world, the earth split open. Levitating obelisks rose from scorched ground \u2014 massive, silent, and humming with infernal energy.\u00a0 From them came the <i>Fallen</i>. Demonic. Unstoppable. Without mercy. They swept across what remained of mankind. Now, only one stronghold endures: Arx Ultima. You are the final commander. Deploy your deck. Defend the bastion. Survive the siege. Or be erased with the rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of Urtuk: The Desolation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cards are soldiers. Your deck is your army. Your fortress is the last thing standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo Bastion fuses tactical turn-based combat, tower defense pressure, and brutal deckbuilding into one grim siege.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy. Command. Survive. Or fall \u2014 and lose everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0\ud83c\udff0 DEFEND THE LAST FORTRESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is lost. Only <strong>Arx Ultima</strong> stands. In <i>Echo Bastion</i>, you command the last line of defense in a fusion of <strong>turn-based tactics</strong>, <strong>deckbuilding</strong>, and <strong>tower defense</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682750/extras/bec0650653f79bc593f978e8495b05c3.poster.avif?t=1746731083\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682750/extras/bec0650653f79bc593f978e8495b05c3.webm?t=1746731083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682750/extras/bec0650653f79bc593f978e8495b05c3.mp4?t=1746731083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83c\udfb4 BUILD YOUR DECK \u2014 AND THEN SURVIVE WITH IT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card in your deck is a <strong>living unit</strong> \u2014 soldiers, machines, or tactical support.<br> Deploy them to the battlefield and take direct control.<br> But beware: deployed cards are <strong>exhausted</strong> until they survive the mission.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unit cards can be used only once per skirmish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"