3e7aaccb3565f4c2a290b2bfeef89f5c.mp4?t=1746731083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the Great War shattered the world, the earth split open. Levitating obelisks rose from scorched ground \u2014 massive, silent, and humming with infernal energy.\u00a0 From them came the <i>Fallen</i>. Demonic. Unstoppable. Without mercy. They swept across what remained of mankind. Now, only one stronghold endures: Arx Ultima. You are the final commander. Deploy your deck. Defend the bastion. Survive the siege. Or be erased with the rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of Urtuk: The Desolation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
